# The Tauri build rewrites the deep-link plugin's autogenerated permission
# files with LF endings on every compile, while core.autocrlf=true checks
# those files out with CRLF. Git then reports them as modified even though
# their content is unchanged. Keeping EOL conversion off for the generated
# permission files makes the worktree byte-identical to the blobs, so they
# stay clean after a build.
src-tauri/vendor/tauri-plugin-deep-link/permissions/** -text
